      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "459",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "计算：",
        "а) $(\\frac{4}{15}+\\frac{7}{12}-\\frac{19}{20})\\times2.5+0.25$；",
        "б) $30+2.8\\div(\\frac{4}{25}-\\frac{9}{15}-\\frac{1}{6})$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "460",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "任意找出下列不等式的两个解：",
        "а) $|x-1|<1$；　　б) $|x+3|<0.1$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "27. 线性方程组的特殊情形"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "到现在为止，我们只会用图解法解方程组。但是图解法",
        "往往很不方便，例如图象的交点离原点很远的情况就是这样。",
        "另外，图解法不能保证结果有很高的精确性，因此常常采用",
        "其他的解法。现在我们就来学习这些解法。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "两个线性方程组成的方程组中，如果一个方程有一个变",
        "量的系数等于零，那么这个方程组不必作图就可以很容易地",
        "求解。举例如下。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例 1. 解方程组",
        "$\\begin{cases}3x-7y=2,\\\\↵2x+0y=20.\\end{cases}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "设 $q$ 是任意数，当变量 $x$ 和 $y$ 取的值组成 $(10,q)$ 形式的",
        "数对时，任何一个这样的数对都满足方程 $2x+0y=20$，而其",
        "他的数对都不满足方程。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
